{title: 643 - Father, Who on Us Do Shower}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #643 • CHARING • 8.8.8.7}
{lyricist: Percy Dearmer}
{composer: Studley L. Russell}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 643}
{meta: tune CHARING}
{meta: meter 8.8.8.7}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Father, [F#m]who on us [A]do [Bm/F#]shower
[D]Gifts [Bm]of [A]plenty [Bm]form [G]Your [F#m]dower,
[Em]To [F#m]Your [G]people [Em/G]give [C#dim]the power
[D]All [Bm]Your [A]gifts [D]to [Em]use [G/D]aright.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Give [Em]pure [F#m]happiness [A]in [Bm/F#]leisure
[D]Temperance [A]in [D]every [F#m]pleasure,
[Em]Wholesome [G]use [Bm]of [Em/G]earthly [C#dim]treasure
[D]Bodies [A]clean [D]and [Em]spirits [D]bright.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Lift from [Em]this [F#m]and every [Bm/F#]nation
[D]All [Bm]that [A]brings [D]us [Bm]degradation;
[Em]Quell [F#m]the [G]forces [Em/G]of [C#dim]temptation;
[D]Put [Bm]Your [A]enemies [G/D]to [D]flight.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]Father, [F#m]You who sought [A]and [Bm/F#]found [A]us,
[D]Son [Bm]of [A]God, [D]whose [Bm]love [G]has [F#m]bound [Em]us,
[Em]Holy [G]Spirit, [Em/G]in [C#dim]us, round [A]us,
[D]Hear [Bm]us, [A]Godhead [Em]infinite.
{end_of_verse}
